ne hour with both brothers, 30 edited photographs and a one-minute edited film. Decoration is separate. Availability and separately quoted charges are confirmed before booking.\",\n          \"itemOffered\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Service\",\n            \"name\": \"Proposal photography and film\",\n            \"serviceType\": \"Proposal photography and videography\",\n            \"provider\": {\"@id\": \"https://sidebysouth.com/#organization\"},\n            \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"AdministrativeArea\", \"name\": \"Miami-Dade County, Florida\"}\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n          \"name\": \"Proposal photo + film with Velvet Heart and carpet\",\n          \"price\": \"1250.00\",\n          \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n          \"url\": \"https://sidebysouth.com/#coverage\",\n          \"seller\": {\"@id\": \"https://sidebysouth.com/#organization\"},\n          \"description\": \"One hour of Side by South photo and film coverage, 30 edited photographs and a one-minute edited film, with Yes Miami Velvet Heart decoration and carpet. Includes the approved $100 media bundle saving. Decoration is fulfilled by Yes Miami. Availability, the exact setup and separately quoted charges are confirmed before booking.\",\n          \"itemOffered\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Service\",\n            \"name\": \"Proposal photo, film and Velvet Heart decoration bundle\",\n            \"serviceType\": \"Proposal photography and videography with partner decoration\",\n            \"provider\": {\"@id\": \"https://sidebysouth.com/#organization\"},\n            \"areaServed\": {\"@type\": \"AdministrativeArea\", \"name\": \"Miami-Dade County, Florida\"}\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#content\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header frame\" id=\"top\">\n<a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Side by South home\">Side by South</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"nav-film\" href=\"#film\">Film</a><a class=\"nav-photos\" href=\"#photos\">Photos</a><a href=\"#coverage\">Coverage</a></nav>\n<a class=\"button\" href=\"#inquire\">Check your date <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></span></a>\n</header>\n<main id=\"content\">\n<section class=\"hero frame\" aria-labelledby=\"brand-title\">\n<h1 id=\"brand-title\">Side by South</h1>\n<div class=\"hero-intro\"><p>Miami proposal photography and film,<br>made by two brothers.</p><div class=\"hero-offer\"><p>Photo + film only, $600</p><p class=\"small\">One hour. 30 edited photos. A one-minute film.</p><p class=\"hero-scope\"><strong>Decoration pictured costs extra.</strong><br><a href=\"#decoration\">Explore Yes Miami proposal setups</a>.</p><p class=\"hero-bundle-example\">Example: photo + film with Velvet Heart and carpet, <strong>$1,250</strong>. <a href=\"#coverage\" data-package-offer=\"velvet-photo-film\">Build your full package</a>.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-media\">\n<figure class=\"hero-still\"><button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/hero-proposal.webp\" data-alt=\"He kneels to propose as she reacts on the beach.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the proposal photograph\"><img src=\"assets/hero-proposal.webp\" alt=\"He kneels to propose as she reacts on the beach.\" width=\"1069\" height=\"1600\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></button><figcaption><span>One question, held in a photograph.</span><span>Photography</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"hero-film\" id=\"film\"><div class=\"moving-frame\"><video id=\"ambient-video\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"assets/film-poster.webp\" aria-label=\"Muted proposal film preview\"><source src=\"assets/proposal-loop.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><button class=\"play-film\" data-play-film aria-label=\"Play the full one-minute proposal film with sound\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 20\" width=\"14\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M1 1 17 10 1 19Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>Play film</button></div><div class=\"film-caption\"><div><p>And the way it felt.</p><p class=\"small\">The same proposal, in sixty seconds.</p></div><button class=\"text-button\" id=\"preview-toggle\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause preview</button></div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"photo-story section-space\" id=\"photos\" aria-labelledby=\"photos-title\">\n<div class=\"section-heading frame\"><h2 id=\"photos-title\">A Miami proposal</h2><p>From the question on the beach to their first portrait together. Photographs and film from one day.</p></div>\n<div class=\"photo-strip frame\">\n<button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/ring-moment.webp\" data-alt=\"The couple shares a close moment with the ring during their beach proposal.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the ring moment photograph\"><img src=\"assets/ring-moment.webp\" alt=\"The couple shares a close moment with the ring during their beach proposal.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1114\" height=\"1600\"></button>\n<button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/ring-detail.webp\" data-alt=\"A close view of the engagement ring on her hand.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the ring detail photograph\"><img src=\"assets/ring-detail.webp\" alt=\"A close view of the engagement ring on her hand.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1130\" height=\"1600\"></button>\n<button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/kiss.webp\" data-alt=\"The newly engaged couple kisses on the beach.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the kiss photograph\"><img src=\"assets/kiss.webp\" alt=\"The newly engaged couple kisses on the beach.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1253\" height=\"1600\"></button>\n<button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/embrace.webp\" data-alt=\"The couple embraces after the proposal.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the embrace photograph\"><img src=\"assets/embrace.webp\" alt=\"The couple embraces after the proposal.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1079\" height=\"1600\"></button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"strip-caption frame\"><p class=\"small\">Photo + film by Side by South</p><button class=\"text-button\" data-play-film>Watch the full film <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"coverage coverage-builder section-space frame\" id=\"coverage\" aria-labelledby=\"pricing-title\">\n      <div class=\"builder-heading\"><h2 id=\"pricing-title\">Choose your proposal.</h2><p>Start with photo, film or both. Add a Yes Miami setting if you would like decoration, too. Your selection and price carry through to the inquiry.</p></div>\n      <fieldset class=\"mode-picker\"><legend class=\"sr-only\">Include a decoration setting?</legend><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"package-mode\" value=\"bundle\"><span>Coverage + decoration</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"package-mode\" value=\"media\" checked><span>Coverage only</span></label></fieldset>\n      <div class=\"builder-layout\">\n        <section class=\"setup-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"setting-title\">\n          <h3 id=\"setting-title\">The setting is separate</h3>\n          <div id=\"setup-controls\" hidden>\n            <label class=\"field-label\" for=\"setup-select\">Decoration by Yes Miami</label><select id=\"setup-select\"><option value=\"velvet\">Velvet Heart · $690</option><option value=\"ultimate\">Ultimate Heart Experience · $890</option><option value=\"grand\">Grand Love Experience · $1,150</option></select>\n            <figure class=\"setup-photo\"><img id=\"setup-image\" src=\"assets/yes-miami/03.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"Velvet Heart reference setting by Yes Miami.\"><figcaption>Reference image by Yes Miami. Pictured bouquet arrangements and other upgrades are included only when listed in your quote.</figcaption></figure>\n            <div class=\"setup-details\"><h4 id=\"setup-name\">Velvet Heart</h4><p id=\"setup-inclusions\">7.9-foot silk rose heart, LED sign, 200+ silk roses, 100+ LED candles, music, setup and breakdown.</p><a id=\"setup-source\" href=\"https://www.yes-miami.com/service-page/velvet-heart-proposal-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Partner package details <svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></a></div>\n            <label class=\"carpet-option\"><input id=\"carpet-option\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span id=\"carpet-label\">Add carpet <strong>+$60</strong></span></label><p class=\"small\" id=\"carpet-help\">Carpet is an optional addition to this setting.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"media-only-setting\"><p class=\"media-setting-title\">You arrange the setting.</p><p>Choose photo, film or both. The media price covers our work; flowers, rose hearts, carpet, candles and other decoration are not part of coverage-only pricing.</p></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <div class=\"coverage-panel\">\n          <fieldset class=\"coverage-options\"><legend><h3>Your coverage</h3></legend>\n            <label class=\"coverage-row\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"coverage\" value=\"photo\"><span class=\"coverage-text\"><strong data-title=\"photo\">Photography</strong><span>One hour of photography.<br>30 edited photographs.</span><small hidden data-saving=\"photo\">Save $50 when bundled</small></span><span class=\"row-price\" data-price=\"photo\">$350</span></label>\n            <label class=\"coverage-row\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"coverage\" value=\"film\"><span class=\"coverage-text\"><strong data-title=\"film\">Film</strong><span>One hour of filming.<br>A one-minute edited film.</span><small hidden data-saving=\"film\">Save $50 when bundled</small></span><span class=\"row-price\" data-price=\"film\">$400</span></label>\n            <label class=\"coverage-row\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"coverage\" value=\"both\" checked><span class=\"coverage-text\"><strong data-title=\"both\">Photo + film</strong><span>One hour with both brothers.<br>30 edited photos + a one-minute film.</span><small hidden data-saving=\"both\">Save an additional $100 when bundled</small></span><span class=\"row-price\" data-price=\"both\">$600</span></label>\n          </fieldset>\n          <section class=\"quote-summary\" aria-labelledby=\"summary-title\"><h3 id=\"summary-title\">Your package</h3><p id=\"summary-description\">Photo + film coverage only. Decoration arranged separately.</p><dl><div><dt id=\"media-line-label\">Photo + film coverage</dt><dd id=\"media-line-price\">$600</dd></div><div data-decoration-line hidden><dt id=\"decoration-line-label\">Velvet Heart decoration</dt><dd id=\"decoration-line-price\">$690</dd></div><div data-carpet-line hidden><dt id=\"carpet-line-label\">Carpet</dt><dd id=\"carpet-line-price\">$60</dd></div><div class=\"discount-line\" data-discount-line hidden><dt>Additional bundle saving</dt><dd id=\"discount-line-price\">−$100</dd></div><div class=\"total-line\"><dt>Package total</dt><dd id=\"package-total\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">$600</dd></div></dl><p class=\"saving-note\" id=\"saving-note\">The $600 combined rate saves $150 compared with photography at $350 and film at $400.</p><p id=\"media-deposit-note\" class=\"small muted media-deposit-note\">Media reservation deposit: $180 (30% of the $600 media fee). Decoration is not included.</p><p id=\"selection-summary\" class=\"selected-package-note\" aria-live=\"polite\">Your choice: Photo + film coverage only. Decoration arranged separately.</p><a class=\"button\" id=\"coverage-cta\" href=\"#inquire\" aria-label=\"Request availability for photo and film coverage only, $600 before separately quoted extras\">Request this package <svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></a><p class=\"quote-note\">Availability and the exact setup are confirmed before booking. Venue, permit, parking or access charges, travel outside Miami-Dade and tax treatment are confirmed in the quote. An inquiry does not reserve a date.</p><div class=\"bundle-contact-options\"><a class=\"text-button\" data-instagram href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sidebysouth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prefer Instagram? Message us <svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></a><br><button class=\"text-button\" id=\"copy-inquiry\">Copy inquiry for Instagram</button><p id=\"copy-status\" class=\"small\" role=\"status\"></p></div></section>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n<section class=\"brothers section-space frame\" aria-labelledby=\"brothers-title\">\n<figure class=\"portrait\"><button class=\"photo-button\" data-photo=\"assets/portrait.webp\" data-alt=\"The newly engaged couple stands together by the ocean.\" aria-label=\"Enlarge the couple’s portrait\"><img src=\"assets/portrait.webp\" alt=\"The newly engaged couple stands together by the ocean.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1127\" height=\"1600\"></button><figcaption>Client portrait. Photographed by Side by South.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"brothers-copy\"><h2 id=\"brothers-title\">Photo + film.<br>One Miami team.</h2><p class=\"statement\">Behind the cameras, Side by South is a team of two brothers. One photographs and one films, so you can arrange both with the same team.</p><p>Tell us your date or date window and the location you have in mind. We’ll plan the coverage together and confirm the details with you before the day.</p><div class=\"side-facts\"><p>Based in Miami</p><p>Photography + film</p></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"partner section-space\" id=\"decoration\" aria-labelledby=\"partner-title\">\n<div class=\"section-heading frame\"><h2 id=\"partner-title\">Set the scene<br>with Yes Miami</h2><div><p>Rose hearts, flowers and proposal settings by our partner Yes Miami. Their decoration and our photo + film coverage are priced separately.</p><a class=\"text-button\" href=\"decorations.html\">See all 30 setups <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></span></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"partner-layout frame\"><figure class=\"partner-large\"><a class=\"partner-image\" href=\"decorations.html#catalog\" aria-label=\"Explore the Velvet Heart Proposal Package\"><img src=\"assets/yes-miami/03.webp\" alt=\"Velvet Heart proposal decoration by Yes Miami.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\"></a><figcaption><span>Velvet Heart Proposal Package</span><span>$690</span></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"partner-small\"><figure><a class=\"partner-image\" href=\"decorations.html#catalog\" aria-label=\"Explore The Elegant Heart Experience\"><img src=\"assets/yes-miami/04.webp\" alt=\"The Elegant Heart Experience decoration by Yes Miami.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\"></a><figcaption><span>The Elegant Heart Experience</span><span>$790</span></figcaption></figure><figure><a class=\"partner-image\" href=\"decorations.html#catalog\" aria-label=\"Explore The Ultimate Heart Experience\"><img src=\"assets/yes-miami/05.webp\" alt=\"The Ultimate Heart Experience decoration by Yes Miami.\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"1200\"></a><figcaption><span>The Ultimate Heart Experience</span><span>$890</span></figcaption></figure></div></div>\n<p class=\"partner-credit small muted frame\">Decoration and setup photographs by <a href=\"https://www.yes-miami.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yes Miami</a>. Published prices checked October 24, 2026. Images may show optional upgrades. Your final quote confirms the setup, availability and any venue, travel or upgrade charges.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"booking section-space frame\" id=\"booking\" aria-labelledby=\"booking-title\">\n<div class=\"booking-intro\"><h2 id=\"booking-title\">Booking and <br>delivery.</h2><p class=\"booking-promise\">Your selected edited files are ready within 24 hours of the shoot ending.</p><p>Pay the remaining media balance after the shoot, before final download access. Your private gallery stays available for 90 days from first delivery.</p></div>\n<ol class=\"booking-steps\">\n<li><h3>Share your plan.</h3><p>Send your date or date window, location and chosen coverage. We check our availability and, when requested, the Yes Miami setup.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Agree the details.</h3><p>We provide an itemized quote and media agreement for you to review and accept. Decoration, optional upgrades and any extra charges are confirmed before booking.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Reserve in writing.</h3><p>The media deposit is 30% of your selected media fee, after any approved bundle saving. We verify receipt and send written media reservation confirmation. Yes Miami decoration payments and reservation are confirmed separately.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</section>\n<section class=\"questions section-space frame\" aria-labelledby=\"questions-title\"><h2 id=\"questions-title\">Before you<br>message</h2><div class=\"question-list\">\n<details><summary>What does $600 include?</summary><p>The $600 package covers one hour of photography and filming by both brothers, 30 edited photographs and a one-minute edited film. The rose-heart setup and decorations have a separate price.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can I book one service?</summary><p>Yes. Photography is $350 for one hour and 30 edited photographs. Film is $400 for one hour and a one-minute edited film.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Where do you work?</summary><p>Miami and South Florida. Send the location you have in mind when you message us.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Is decoration included?</summary><p>Coverage-only prices exclude decoration. Choose coverage + decoration to include the selected Yes Miami setting and any carpet option in your package total. Your quote confirms the exact setup, availability and any extra charges.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can we discuss a location?</summary><p>Yes. Tell us what you’re planning and what’s still undecided, along with your date or date window.</p></details>\n<details><summary>When and how will we receive our files?</summary><p>Your selected photos and film are ready within 24 hours of the shoot ending. The remaining media balance is due after the shoot and before we release your private download gallery. Gallery access lasts 90 days from first delivery. Photos are high-resolution JPEGs; the one-minute film is a vertical 1080p MP4.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Does sending an inquiry reserve our date?</summary><p>No. We confirm availability and agree your quote and media agreement first. Your media reservation is confirmed after we verify the 30% media deposit has been received and send written confirmation. For a bundle, Yes Miami confirms decoration under its separate payment and reservation terms.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Do you cover weddings?</summary><p>Yes. Message us your wedding date and location to discuss photography and film coverage.</p></details>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"inquiry section-space frame\" id=\"inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"inquiry-title\">\n<div class=\"inquiry-intro\"><p class=\"small muted\">YOUR MIAMI PROPOSAL</p><h2 id=\"inquiry-title\">Tell us<br> the plan.</h2><p>Share a few details and we’ll reply on Instagram to discuss availability and coverage.</p><p class=\"small muted\">Your selected package is itemized below. We confirm availability, the setup and the final quote before booking. Sending an inquiry does not reserve a date.</p><div class=\"inquiry-package\"><h3>Your selection</h3><p id=\"inquiry-package-name\">Photo + film coverage only. Decoration arranged separately.</p><strong id=\"inquiry-package-price\">$600</strong><p class=\"small muted\" id=\"inquiry-package-saving\">Coverage only. Decoration is priced separately.</p><p class=\"small muted\" id=\"inquiry-media-deposit\">Media reservation deposit: $180 (30% of the $600 media fee). Decoration is not included.</p><a class=\"text-button\" href=\"#coverage\">Change coverage or add decoration</a></div><a class=\"text-button\" data-instagram href=\"https://www.instagram.com/sidebysouth/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Message @sidebysouth instead <svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 15 15 3M3 3h12v12\"/></svg></a></div>\n<div><form id=\"inquiry-form\" class=\"inquiry-form\">\n<div class=\"inquiry-fields\"><label>Your name<input name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"First and last name\"></label><label>Instagram username<input name=\"instagram\" required maxlength=\"31\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\" pattern=\"@?[A-Za-z0-9._]{1,30}\" placeholder=\"@yourname\"><span class=\"small muted\">We’ll reply to this account.</span></label></div>\n<div class=\"inquiry-fields\"><label>Preferred date<input type=\"date\" name=\"eventDate\"></label><label>Coverage<select name=\"coverage\"><option value=\"both\">Photo + film</option><option value=\"photo\">Photography</option><option value=\"film\">Film</option><option value=\"unsure\">Help me choose</option></select></label></div>\n<label>Miami-area location<input name=\"eventLocation\" required maxlength=\"160\" placeholder=\"Miami Beach, or still deciding\"></label>\n<label>Anything you’d like us to know? <span class=\"small muted\">Optional</span><textarea name=\"notes\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"1200\" placeholder=\"Your date window, preferred time, or decoration idea\" aria-describedby=\"inquiry-notes-help\"></textarea><span class=\"small muted\" id=\"inquiry-notes-help\">Your package selection is included automatically. Add up to 1,200 characters of optional notes.</span></label>\n<div class=\"inquiry-honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>Company<input name=\"company\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div>\n<label class=\"inquiry-consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Use these details to reply to my inquiry. <a href=\"privacy.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Privacy</a></span></label>\n<p class=\"small muted\">We save your inquiry and the campaign link that brought you here to understand which ads lead to bookings. No card or payment details are requested.</p>\n<button class=\"button\" type=\"submit\">Request availability <span aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focu